# Local import shim: symlinks __init__.py / utils.py / build/_loop_cgal.so into
# one directory so `PYTHONPATH=.local-shim` imports the locally built extension.
# Needed because the source `loop_cgal/` package has no .so and shadows the build.
.local-shim/
